WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:16.956
The family was at an amusement park.

2
00:00:16.957 --> 00:00:24.487
"Look at all the rides!" said Harry.

3
00:00:24.488 --> 00:00:29.792
He saw a roller coaster far away.

4
00:00:29.793 --> 00:00:32.914
Its cars went up and down the track.

5
00:00:32.915 --> 00:00:36.768
It looked like lots of fun.

6
00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:40.797
"Let's go on that roller coaster!" said Harry.

7
00:00:40.798 --> 00:00:43.331
"Great idea!" said Dad.

8
00:00:43.332 --> 00:00:49.533
The family walked toward the roller coaster.

9
00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:53.413
But Oliver saw a merry-go-round.

10
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:56.923
"I want to go on that!" said Oliver.

11
00:00:56.924 --> 00:01:01.770
"Me too," said Emmy.

12
00:01:01.771 --> 00:01:10.129
"I love merry-go-rounds," said Mom.

13
00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.302
Everyone rode the merry-go-round.

14
00:01:13.303 --> 00:01:16.432
Harry sat on a horse.

15
00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:20.065
"This is a baby ride," he thought.

16
00:01:20.066 --> 00:01:25.300
"The roller coaster will be more fun."

17
00:01:25.301 --> 00:01:29.762
The family walked some more.

18
00:01:29.763 --> 00:01:38.179
The roller coaster looked bigger now.

19
00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.028
"Oh, a Ferris wheel!" said Emmy.

20
00:01:42.029 --> 00:01:52.856
"Let's go on it!" said Aunt Judy.

21
00:01:52.857 --> 00:01:59.877
Everyone got on the Ferris wheel.

22
00:01:59.878 --> 00:02:04.908
It went up very high.

23
00:02:04.909 --> 00:02:08.941
Harry yawned.

24
00:02:08.942 --> 00:02:13.132
"This Ferris wheel is so slow," Harry thought.

25
00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:16.208
"The roller coaster will be much faster."

26
00:02:16.209 --> 00:02:19.800
The family walked some more.

27
00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:26.131
Finally they got to the roller coaster.

28
00:02:26.132 --> 00:02:29.456
Harry looked up and gulped.

29
00:02:29.457 --> 00:02:32.861
The roller coaster looked really scary now.

30
00:02:32.862 --> 00:02:35.381
The cars flew down the track.

31
00:02:35.382 --> 00:02:40.582
The riders screamed.

32
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:44.342
"Harry, where are you going?" called Dad.

33
00:02:44.343 --> 00:02:54.705
"Back to the merry-go-round!" yelled Harry.
